{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# Sprint 007 D2B — Package tradability\n",
        "\n",
        "Accepted D2A branch: **`package_tradability`**. This notebook reuses the accepted Laspeyres D2A bridge and asks whether \(\Delta_{\mathrm{price}}\) concentrates in ex-ante expensive packages.\n",
        "\n",
        "Per trade, from **shared** quotes:\n",
        "\n",
        "```\n",
        "package_half_spread        = 0.5 × Σ |unit_quantity| × (ask − bid)\n",
        "midpoint_package_cashflow  = Σ unit_quantity × (bid + 0.5 × (ask − bid))\n",
        "package_width_to_cashflow  = package_half_spread / |midpoint_package_cashflow|\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "Terciles are formed **separately within** `(direction, instrument_type)`. Zero-cashflow packages are skipped and disclosed. No cutoff search, no trade removal, no filtered-strategy P&L, no D3 design.\n",
        "\n",
        "Branch 3 does **not** set `structure`. The final D3 class is the frozen precedence applied to D2A predicates after this diagnostic."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "import sys\n",
        "from pathlib import Path\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "def _repo_root() -> Path:\n",
        "    here = Path.cwd().resolve()\n",
        "    for candidate in (here, *here.parents):\n",
        "        if (candidate / \"src\" / \"backtest\").is_dir() and (candidate / \"setup.py\").exists():\n",
        "            return candidate\n",
        "    raise RuntimeError(\"Could not locate MomentumCVG repo root (set cwd or PYTHONPATH)\")\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "REPO_ROOT = _repo_root()\n",
        "if str(REPO_ROOT) not in sys.path:\n",
        "    sys.path.insert(0, str(REPO_ROOT))\n",
        "\n",
        "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
        "import pandas as pd\n",
        "\n",
        "from src.backtest.sprint007_artifact_validation import run_d0_validation\n",
        "from src.backtest.sprint007_d1_gross_margin import run_d1_analysis\n",
        "from src.backtest.sprint007_d2_shortfall_bridge import BRANCH_TRADABILITY, run_d2a_analysis\n",
        "from src.backtest.sprint007_d2b_package_tradability import run_d2b_analysis\n",
        "\n",
        "pd.set_option(\"display.float_format\", lambda v: f\"{v:,.4f}\")\n",
        "plt.rcParams[\"figure.figsize\"] = (8, 3.8)"
      ],
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 1. Accepted D2A (do not recompute a second bridge)\n",
        "\n",
        "D2A must already recommend `package_tradability`. Numbers below are the accepted helper output."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "d0 = run_d0_validation()\n",
        "d1 = run_d1_analysis(d0_result=d0)\n",
        "d2a = run_d2a_analysis(d0_result=d0, d1_result=d1)\n",
        "if d2a.blocked or d2a.classification is None or d2a.bridge is None:\n",
        "    raise RuntimeError(f\"D2A blocked — do not run D2B: {d2a.blocker}\")\n",
        "if d2a.classification.d2b_branch != BRANCH_TRADABILITY:\n",
        "    raise RuntimeError(\n",
        "        f\"Accepted branch is {d2a.classification.d2b_branch}, not {BRANCH_TRADABILITY}\"\n",
        "    )\n",
        "\n",
        "b = d2a.bridge\n",
        "accepted = pd.Series(\n",
        "    {\n",
        "        \"P_mid\": b.p_mid,\n",
        "        \"P_cross\": b.p_cross,\n",
        "        \"G\": b.gap,\n",
        "        \"Δ_price\": b.delta_price,\n",
        "        \"Δ_size\": b.delta_size,\n",
        "        \"Δ_set\": b.delta_set,\n",
        "        \"R\": b.residual,\n",
        "        \"D2B branch\": d2a.classification.d2b_branch,\n",
        "        \"provisional D3 class\": d2a.classification.provisional_d3_class,\n",
        "    },\n",
        "    name=\"accepted D2A\",\n",
        ").to_frame()\n",
        "display(accepted)"
      ],
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 2. D2B diagnostic\n",
        "\n",
        "Zero-cashflow packages are excluded from terciles and shown separately. Reconciliation requires per-trade \(\Delta_{\mathrm{price}}\) and tercile+skipped sums to match accepted D2A \(\Delta_{\mathrm{price}}\)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "d2b = run_d2b_analysis(d2a_result=d2a)\n",
        "if d2b.blocked:\n",
        "    raise RuntimeError(f\"D2B blocked: {d2b.blocker}\")\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"ranked trades:\", d2b.n_ranked)\n",
        "print(\"skipped zero-cashflow:\", d2b.n_skipped_zero_cashflow)\n",
        "display(pd.DataFrame(d2b.reconciliation))\n",
        "display(pd.DataFrame([d2b.skipped]))"
      ],
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 3. Terciles within `(direction, instrument_type)`\n",
        "\n",
        "Tercile 3 is the expensive slice **inside that group**. Long straddles and short iron flies are not pooled before ranking."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "groups = pd.DataFrame(d2b.group_terciles)\n",
        "display(groups)"
      ],
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 4. Book-level expensive slice\n",
        "\n",
        "Book terciles stack the within-group ranks. Report how much \(\Delta_{\mathrm{price}}\) sits in tercile 3 and whether midpoint P&L stays positive in terciles 1–2. That is a description, not a filter winner."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "book = pd.DataFrame(d2b.book_terciles)\n",
        "display(book)\n",
        "summary = pd.Series(\n",
        "    {\n",
        "        \"expensive |Δ_price| / |Δ_price|\": d2b.expensive_share_of_delta_price,\n",
        "        \"mid P&L outside expensive (T1+T2)\": d2b.mid_pnl_outside_expensive,\n",
        "        \"positive mid margin outside expensive\": d2b.mid_margin_outside_expensive,\n",
        "    },\n",
        "    name=\"book\",\n",
        ").to_frame()\n",
        "display(summary)\n",
        "\n",
        "fig, axes = plt.subplots(1, 2, figsize=(10, 3.6))\n",
        "axes[0].bar(book[\"tercile\"].astype(str), book[\"delta_price\"], color=\"#d62728\")\n",
        "axes[0].axhline(0.0, color=\"#888888\", linewidth=0.8)\n",
        "axes[0].set_title(\"Δ_price by book tercile\")\n",
        "axes[0].set_xlabel(\"tercile (3 = expensive within group)\")\n",
        "axes[0].set_ylabel(\"dollars\")\n",
        "axes[1].bar(book[\"tercile\"].astype(str), book[\"pnl_total_mid\"], color=\"#1f77b4\")\n",
        "axes[1].axhline(0.0, color=\"#888888\", linewidth=0.8)\n",
        "axes[1].set_title(\"Midpoint P&L by book tercile\")\n",
        "axes[1].set_xlabel(\"tercile\")\n",
        "axes[1].set_ylabel(\"dollars\")\n",
        "plt.tight_layout()\n",
        "plt.show()"
      ],
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 5. Final D3 class\n",
        "\n",
        "Precedence: `D2_BLOCKED` → `D3_MIXED_MECHANISM` → `D3_SIZING_AWARE` → `D3_STRUCTURE_CONDITIONED` → `D3_EXECUTION_FOCUSED`.\n",
        "\n",
        "This cell **calculates** the class from D2A predicates plus D2B pass/fail. It does not hardcode a label and does not start D3."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "cls = d2a.classification\n",
        "final = pd.Series(\n",
        "    {\n",
        "        \"blocked\": d2b.blocked,\n",
        "        \"price_material\": cls.price_material,\n",
        "        \"size_material\": cls.size_material,\n",
        "        \"order_sensitive\": cls.order_sensitive,\n",
        "        \"structure\": cls.structure,\n",
        "        \"provisional D3 class\": cls.provisional_d3_class,\n",
        "        \"final D3 class\": d2b.final_d3_class,\n",
        "    },\n",
        "    name=\"handoff\",\n",
        ").to_frame()\n",
        "display(final)\n",
        "print(\"STOP: no D3 design, no filter, no official evidence export in this implementation step.\")"
      ],
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    }
  ],
